'' A UDT AS A PROPERTY SETTER'S VALUE runs its cast: a string cast into 'byref v as string', a
'' numeric one into 'byval v as long'. tiko found no setter for the string one and wrote over the
'' getter (a crash); the numeric one stored into the getter's address. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/udt-setter.bas -o tests/codegen/udtsetter.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/udtsetter.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d] 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [s]ab
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d] 103
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d] 6.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d] 3
